kind: scene
id: camp.mourning
title: Cairns
on: camp
priority: 40
when: "count(mourned(_)) >= 1"
---

## Cairns

@narrator: The party builds cairns at the edge of the camp, where the wagons can't roll over them. It takes longer than it should. Nobody hurries.
@corvin{when="holds(fell(isolde)) && holds(inParty(corvin))"}: She'd have given a speech. I'm not going to. She'd have hated mine anyway.
@isolde{when="holds(fell(corvin)) && holds(inParty(isolde))"}: He owed me four silver. I'll let him keep it.
@isolde{when="holds(fell(wren)) && holds(inParty(isolde))"}: She would want this by the water. We'll carry a stone to the far bank for her.
@narrator{when="count(inParty(_)) == 0"}: There is nobody left to build a cairn with. You build it anyway.
